  {
   "id": "f0NUDvOYEUQJ",
   "from": "Brandon Hurr",
   "author": "27405c4b711a1080",
   "date": "2012-07-07T18:12:37Z",
   "subject": "Re: Rainbow Gradient with geom_density2d",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Very pretty, thanks Joran and Dennis. <div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sat, Jul 7, 2012 at 7:09 PM, Dennis Murphy <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">djm...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Hi Brandon:<br><br>Joran is on the right track, and in fact you can find a suitable template example on the ggplot2-0.9 help pages. I needed some practice, so came up with this:<br>\r\n\r\n<br>require(MASS)</blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><br>require(ggplot2)<br>\r\nrequire(scales)<br>df &lt;- data.frame(x = rnorm(15000),y=rnorm(15000))<br><br></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"># 2D density estimate using MASS::kde2d with <br># conversion to data frame:<br>dens &lt;- with(df, kde2d(x, y), n = 50, lims = c(-4, 4, -4, 4))<br>\r\n\r\n\r\nddf &lt;- data.frame(expand.grid(xd = dens$x, yd = dens$y), <br>                  z = as.vector(dens$z))<br><br>p &lt;- ggplot(df, aes(x = x, y = y)) + <br>      geom_point(size = 0.5, alpha = 0.5) +<br>      stat_contour(data = ddf, <br>\r\n\r\n\r\n                   aes(x = xd, y = yd, z = z, color = ..level..), <br>                   size = 1)<br>p + scale_color_gradient(low = &#39;maroon&#39;, high = &#39;yellow&#39;, <br>                         guide = &#39;colorbar&#39;)<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>or alternatively,<br><br>ggplot() +<br>  stat_contour(data = ddf, geom = &#39;polygon&#39;,<br>               aes(x = xd, y = yd, z = z, fill = ..level..)) + <br>  geom_point(data = df, aes(x = x, y = y), <br>               size = 0.5, alpha = 0.5) +<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n  scale_fill_gradient(low = &#39;maroon&#39;, high = &#39;yellow&#39;, <br>                       guide = &#39;colorbar&#39;)<br><br>HTH,<br>Dennis<br><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div><div>On Sat, Jul 7, 2012 at 2:48 AM, Brandon Hurr <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">brando...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
